        "created_at": "2013-04-17T16:48:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think it's just the opposition to the players. Really, there are no villains, as all sides on this are kinda \"bad\" folks - some are just worse than others.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"></p>",
